# Keep host-only build artefacts out of the Docker build context.
#
# obj/ and bin/ are produced by IDE-side `dotnet restore` / `dotnet build`
# (Visual Studio, Rider, JetBrains, dotnet CLI on the host). They embed
# host-specific absolute paths (e.g. NuGet fallback folders under
# 'C:\Program Files (x86)\Microsoft Visual Studio\...') that are invalid
# inside the Linux build container and cause MSB4018 PackagingException
# on `dotnet publish`.

obj/
bin/

# Editor / VCS noise that has no business inside the image either.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
